{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37618","headline":"驻跸华下同年司封员外从翁许共游西溪久违前契戏成寄赠 · 郑谷","name":"驻跸华下同年司封员外从翁许共游西溪久违前契戏成寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北渚牵吟兴，西溪爽共游。\n指期乘禁马，无暇狎沙鸥。\n纵目怀青岛，澄心想碧流。\n明公非不爱，应待泛龙舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37618.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37618","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}